                            PHOENIX EGG			
|YK0================================================================|YKB
	
'A creature that can not die has no need for its eggs.' |WK0- |RKB
Chi Lan
|YK0
The most powerful Phoenix attack. The Phoenix egg is pure
concentrated Ancient Energy which obliterates whatever it
hits. The Monk coalesces the energy into a powerful 
energy ball to hurl at their foes.

|BKBThis is a Grand Master power.
